# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AB Download — environment variables
# Copy to `.env.local` for local development. Never commit real keys.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# OPTIONAL — Official YouTube Data API v3 key
# Get one at: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/library/youtube.googleapis.com
# What it enables for YouTube links: video duration, channel name,
# view counts and higher-resolution thumbnails.
#
# WITHOUT a key the app still works: YouTube links show oEmbed metadata
# (title / author / thumbnail) plus the official embedded player, with a
# clear notice that extended stats need a configured API key.
#
# Server-only secret. Do NOT prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
YOUTUBE_API_KEY=
